meta {
  name: 04_SentAndWithdrawValidation
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  Scenario: Listing and withdrawing sent requests rejects invalid input and ineligible callers

    When the organisation filter is malformed, listing sent requests fails with 400
    When the system user belongs to an organisation that is not KOMM, FYLK or STAT, listing sent requests fails with 403
    When no token is provided, listing sent requests fails with 401
    When the request does not exist, withdrawing fails with 400
    When the system user belongs to an organisation that is not KOMM, FYLK or STAT, withdrawing fails with 403
    When no token is provided, withdrawing fails with 401

  No step creates state, so the scenario needs no cleanup.
}
